  Description: In your youth, you galloped on horseback over vast prairies, serving
    as a vanguard for your settlement, an army, or another group. Seeing so many
    different lands built a thirst in you to adventure and explore the world instead
    of just racing past it. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution
    or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Nature skill
    and the Plains Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Express
    Rider] skill feat.
